  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/061075dac7ea4774504fcd99d877301922d87334.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d91f2f164c38a7aca00524f3629e101eed9db38.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><hr><h1><strong>🐾軟糖</strong></h1><h1>讓你的生物永遠保持幼體，用甜蜜的方式！</h1><hr><h1><strong>📝關於</strong></h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qHB5D9uzHe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d126ae4be2a40425b3b4c8a772552f7c140b2e66.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fsquish%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/688047102278c26706e89bb2a2afa0d12eb4d5ad.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/950513659899780d3fd677f8907af80a2c1a440d.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></a></p><p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zM6G-zVfbxI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>軟糖</strong> 是一個小巧卻充滿魔力的模組，為你的世界帶來一個簡單的理念：<br>\n最可愛的事物，就該永遠保持可愛。</p><p>有了 <strong>軟糖</strong>，所有可馴服或被動的生物都會<strong>永久</strong>保持牠們可愛的幼體型態！沒有計時器、不會長大，只有滿滿的小巧氛圍。🐣💗</p><p>但 <strong>軟糖</strong> 不僅僅是關於小型夥伴。它還透過懷舊的合成方式，引入了全新的甜蜜進展系統：</p><p><strong>🍬 糖果製作：</strong></p><p>利用玩家們很少再碰觸的系統，製作出迷人又美味的甜點：<br>\n營火烹飪和釀造。</p><p>✨ 從<strong>永久</strong>幼體生物到以古法製作的糖果，<strong>軟糖</strong> 為 Minecraft 帶回一股溫柔又俏皮的活力！非常適合喜歡悠閒風格的玩家、模組包創作者，或任何想讓世界變得柔和一些的朋友。（<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>小提醒</strong></span><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">：別吃掉糖果，你可能會覺得有點不舒服</span></strong> 😉）</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>致謝</strong></span></h2><p><strong>特別感謝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fgooberexe.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">gooberexe</a> 為糖果繪製了像素藝術！</strong></p><p><strong>特別感謝 <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mama_native\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mama Native</a> 和 Squish 提供了這個美好的模組點子 &lt;3</strong></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ftokimi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3d91f2f164c38a7aca00524f3629e101eed9db38.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
